# Trained On

> Is this AI training on my prompts? A public, dated record of what AI companies' own terms say about training on your prompts, quoted word for word, and of every time those words changed. Built on Open Terms Archive's recorded history of each document. Free to read and reuse under ODC-By 1.0.

Each answer below is the vendor's own words, with the date Open Terms Archive first recorded them. Nothing is published on one reading: three AI readers from Anthropic, OpenAI and Google must agree, or a person decides. The site quotes; it does not judge any company, and it is not legal advice.

